## Examples

### Landing Page with Hero and Features
```json
{
  "templateData": {
    "root": {"props": {"title": "Home"}},
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "Hero",
        "props": {
          "title": "Welcome to Our Product",
          "description": "The best solution for your needs",
          "buttons": [{"text": "Get Started", "href": "/signup"}]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "Grid",
        "props": {"columns": 3, "gap": 4}
      }
    ],
    "zones": {}
  }
}
```

### Detail Page with Data Binding
```json
{
  "templateData": {
    "root": {"props": {"title": "Product Detail"}},
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "DataBlock",
        "props": {
          "viewId": 123,
          "mode": "single",
          "filters": [{"field": "id", "operator": "=", "value": "{params.product_id}"}]
        }
      }
    ],
    "zones": {
      "DataBlock-1:children": [
        {"type": "TextField", "props": {"fieldId": 45, "label": "Name"}},
        {"type": "NumberField", "props": {"fieldId": 46, "label": "Price", "format": "currency"}}
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

### Response Format (TOON)
- Success: `page:created,5,Home,home` or `pages|3]{id,name,slug,isPublic}:...`
- Failure: `FAILED: error message`
